    "body": "## Line and headline\n\n**Line: cross-state continuation · count 1/3 · headline 437/512 → 437/512.**\n\n## What and why\n\nThe saved437 model from #2162 passes the exposed development threshold, but its transfer qualification was unmeasured. With the model, scorer and grader frozen before a single fresh draw, this result measures complete own-prefix replies on new combinations of familiar memory values. Historical Rust preparation is restored byte-identically; optional compact traces preserve native decisions/states and digest large arrays without changing scoring. No training or checkpoint selection intervened.\n\n**Opposite-outcome question:** if this result came out the other way, would my next step differ? **Yes.** Passing at least52/128 would lead to M2 acceptance review. The observed0/128 instead requires another substantive model-changing learning cycle. No preparation PR was used.\n\n## Result\n\n**REJECT fresh qualification: 0/128 vs52 required. KEEP saved437 as the development baseline; M2 remains open.** Exact development replay remains437/512 across all512 outputs and7,908 retained native step witnesses. Fresh has3 correct openings and4 EOS-ending outputs, all wrong;124 output-limit stops, no context-limit stops, and zero complete replies in all five strata. Eight literal-bank blocks/16 role assignments produce64 histories/128 correlated queries; this does not test new vocabulary or general chat. The30-root exposure census and independent preparation/result readers pass. Two restoration/setup failures are retained separately; neither produced a redraw or model prediction. This panel is now exposed.\n\nFull immutable evidence and producer executables are round-trip verified in iCloud: `codex-m2-fresh-437-20261010`,87,185,408bytes,MD5`e1477906e3d640012702ebd14005b4b5`. Local CPU evaluation455.140033s; no training/GPU/pod/spending. Complete preparation/build/review/delivery/cleanup cost is charged once at closeout under the pre-registered120minute estimate.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Exact-head focused checks:22 core tests +47 preparation executions pass; named rustfmt,diff and claim-wording checks pass (commands/outcomes posted separately)\n- [x] Canonical record: `docs/labs/m2-fresh-437-2026-10-10/README.md`\n- [x] New current-state entry with Next\n- [x] Current claims updated; historical dated NOT_RUN records retain their original scope\n- [x] STATUS/ROADMAP and README updated in existing sections\n- [x] #2028 table and #2030 current state updated after verified merge\n- [x] After merge: fresh origin/main tree verification, branch/worktree deletion, hygiene, full cost/result card\n\nReferences #2030\n",
